    kind: invariant  # cc3f
    title: "env_read -> host_secret: the boundary means 'reads host description' (GOOS, Getwd, Executable, navigator.platform) while the derived taint label and every claim written against it mean 'secret'"  # cc3f
    status: violated  # cc3f
    priority: 2  # cc3f
    parent:  # cc3f
    tags:  # cc3f
    - taint  # cc3f
